  {
   "text": "I couldn't confirm that Lena Okafor's Patient record exists on the server, so I'm reporting this as not done.\n\n- **Before creating:** I waited out the slow server and the Patient list showed 5 records: Dr Petra Lind, Dr Ama Osei, Casey Other, OpenAdapt Bot and Medplum Admin. None was Lena Okafor, so I went ahead and created her record.\n- **The create:** I entered the name, birth date, sex, address, home phone and email, and clicked Create. The app then moved on to a new patient page, which suggests the save went through. When I opened the page's JSON tab, it showed \"Not found\". I never saw the new record's ID.\n- **After creating:** The Patient list flips between \"5 of 5\" without Lena and \"0 of 0\", and the page now looks frozen. I can't tell whether my record was saved, so I can't say Lena has exactly one record. A record may have been created that I couldn't see. Someone should check the Patient list for \"Okafor\" before anyone retries, to avoid a duplicate.\n\nRESULT: NOT DONE: I clicked Create, but the server's responses were inconsistent and I couldn't confirm the record exists or get its ID.",
